<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-063-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.316262" lon="-120.917791"><name>SC26-063-B</name><cmt>SC26-063</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 5.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 59/100; not catch probability. Center 175 ft; nearby 171–188 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-043</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.31731198330542" lon="-120.91858886900117"/><trkpt lat="35.317047332486496" lon="-120.9189256195042"/><trkpt lat="35.31623634207636" lon="-120.91894640458807"/><trkpt lat="35.31624012762058" lon="-120.91916628302114"/><trkpt lat="35.315967904716274" lon="-120.9190632716109"/><trkpt lat="35.31588157994693" lon="-120.91928545834016"/><trkpt lat="35.31561124970944" lon="-120.91929238529788"/><trkpt lat="35.315615034566655" lon="-120.91951226208744"/><trkpt lat="35.31534470427825" lon="-120.91951918822221"/><trkpt lat="35.31515880673706" lon="-120.91919399225195"/><trkpt lat="35.31470636369062" lon="-120.91909560017788"/><trkpt lat="35.314696899115" lon="-120.91854591457489"/><trkpt lat="35.31442088906443" lon="-120.91822303354753"/><trkpt lat="35.314060448901245" lon="-120.91823227368586"/><trkpt lat="35.3140680217